  "description": "TMK Parcels for the State of Hawaii as of May 2026. Sources: County of Hawaii: 4/27/26; County of Maui: 4/15/26; County of Kauai: 5/11/26; City and County of Honolulu: 4/30/26. Hawaii Statewide GIS Program projected to a common projection/datum (UTM Zone 4, NAD 83 HARN) and merged all counties' parcel data into one layer. Where necessary, the State standardized field names or added fields to the county layers such as creating text fields for corresponding numeric tmk fields, etc., and / or calculated values for fields such as links to qpublic websites showing additional information for each parcel. For most current parcel information, please visit the county GIS websites: Hawaii County: https://www.hawaiicounty.gov/departments/information-technology/gis-maps Honolulu County: https://honolulu-cchnl.opendata.arcgis.com/ Kauai County: https://kauai-open-data-kauaigis.hub.arcgis.com/ Maui County: https://mauicounty.maps.arcgis.com/home/index.html The parcel boundaries are intended to provi",
